fixture cam_strike_turns
doc Camera review round 2: standing still, strike left and right alternately every 12 frames (facing a enemy on each side): combat turns
room test/camera
spawn 1600 3200
frames 160
input
  0 L !attack
  12 R !attack
  24 L !attack
  36 R !attack
  48 L !attack
  60 R !attack
  72 L !attack
  84 R !attack
  96 L !attack
  108 R !attack
  120 L !attack
  132 R !attack
end
expect
  at 0 event.attack=1
end
